%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2f0b0c553be8edd4682e9180fdd13e37, type: 3}
  m_Name: I2Languages
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::I2.Loc.LanguageSourceAsset
  mSource:
    UserAgreesToHaveItOnTheScene: 0
    UserAgreesToHaveItInsideThePluginsFolder: 0
    GoogleLiveSyncIsUptoDate: 1
    mTerms:
    - Term: Narrative/BattleIntro/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '*Demonic qi* coils through the bamboo grove - a beast bars the cultivator''s
        path!'
      - "*Y\xEAu kh\xED* cu\u1ED9n l\xEAn gi\u1EEFa r\u1EEBng tr\xFAc - m\u1ED9t
        b\xF3ng y\xEAu th\xFA ch\u1EB7n \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng tu s\u0129!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/BattleIntro/2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - A wild *{e}* blocks the mountain trail, snarling; you have no choice but
        to strike first.
      - "M\u1ED9t con *{e}* hoang d\xE3 ch\u1EB7n l\u1ED1i s\u01A1n \u0111\u1EA1o,
        g\u1EA7m g\u1EEB; b\u1EA1n bu\u1ED9c ph\u1EA3i ra tay tr\u01B0\u1EDBc."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/BattleIntro/3
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Your spirit sense stirs - *{e}* bursts from the lingzhi bed, fangs first!
      - "Th\u1EA7n th\u1EE9c rung \u0111\u1ED9ng - *{e}* v\u1ECDt l\xEAn t\u1EEB
        lu\u1ED1ng linh chi, nanh nh\u1ECDn ch\u1EF1c ch\u1EDD!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/BattleIntro/4
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The spirit spring bubbles... a hungry *{e}* surfaces and charges!
      - "Linh tuy\u1EC1n s\u1EE7i b\u1ECDt... m\u1ED9t con *{e}* \u0111\xF3i kh\xE1t
        tr\u1ED3i l\xEAn v\xE0 lao t\u1EDBi!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/BattleIntro/5
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Wind howls off the cliffs: *{e}* has caught the scent of your qi. Prepare!'
      - "Gi\xF3 r\xEDt qua v\xE1ch \u0111\xE1: *{e}* \u0111\xE3 \u0111\xE1nh h\u01A1i
        th\u1EA5y linh kh\xED c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n. Chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/EliteIntro/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - An *awakened {e}* looms ahead, wreathed in roiling demonic qi!
      - "M\u1ED9t con *{e} th\xE0nh tinh* s\u1EEBng s\u1EEFng ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc,
        y\xEAu kh\xED cu\u1ED3n cu\u1ED9n quanh th\xE2n!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/EliteIntro/2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - This *{e}* has devoured a century of spirit qi - larger, meaner, hungrier.
      - "Con *{e}* n\xE0y \u0111\xE3 nu\u1ED1t tr\u1ECDn tr\u0103m n\u0103m linh
        kh\xED - to h\u01A1n, d\u1EEF h\u01A1n, \u0111\xF3i h\u01A1n."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/BossIntro/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The ground trembles. *{e}*, lord of this realm, descends!
      - "M\u1EB7t \u0111\u1EA5t rung chuy\u1EC3n. *{e}*, ch\xFAa t\u1EC3 c\xF5i n\xE0y,
        gi\xE1ng l\xE2m!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/BossIntro/2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - All falls silent. *{e}* has found you.
      - "V\u1EA1n v\u1EADt im b\u1EB7t. *{e}* \u0111\xE3 t\xECm ra b\u1EA1n."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Win/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The *{e}* scatters into drifting motes of light. You absorb <b>+{xp} qi</b>.
      - "*{e}* tan th\xE0nh mu\xF4n \u0111\u1ED1m s\xE1ng phi\xEAu t\xE1n. B\u1EA1n
        h\u1EA5p th\u1EE5 <b>+{xp} tu vi</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Win/2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '*{e}* flees into the deep woods, defeated. <b>+{xp} qi</b> gathered.'
      - "*{e}* b\u1EA1i tr\u1EADn, l\u1EE7i v\xE0o r\u1EEBng s\xE2u. Thu \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
        <b>+{xp} tu vi</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Win/3
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The beast is subdued. Its scattered essence grants <b>+{xp} qi</b>.
      - "Y\xEAu th\xFA b\u1ECB tr\u1EA5n \xE1p. Tinh hoa t\u1EA3n m\xE1t mang l\u1EA1i
        <b>+{xp} tu vi</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Fortune/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - A wisp of *auspicious qi* coils around your sword hilt.
      - "M\u1ED9t l\xE0n *linh kh\xED c\xE1t t\u01B0\u1EDDng* qu\u1EA5n quanh chu\xF4i
        ki\u1EBFm c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Fortune/2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You sip morning dew from a bamboo leaf. Refreshing!
      - "B\u1EA1n nh\u1EA5p gi\u1ECDt s\u01B0\u01A1ng mai \u0111\u1ECDng tr\xEAn
        l\xE1 tr\xFAc. S\u1EA3ng kho\xE1i!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Fortune/3
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - A sliver of *spirit stone* melts into your dantian.
      - "M\u1ED9t m\u1EA3nh *linh th\u1EA1ch* nh\u1ECF h\xF2a tan v\xE0o \u0111an
        \u0111i\u1EC1n."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Choice/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - A derelict *cave abode* creaks open - a predecessor's legacy lies within...
      - "M\u1ED9t *\u0111\u1ED9ng ph\u1EE7* b\u1ECF hoang h\xE9 m\u1EDF - di s\u1EA3n
        ti\u1EC1n nh\xE2n c\xF2n v\u01B0\u01A1ng b\xEAn trong..."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Choice/2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'In meditation, three *manuals* surface in your mind. Choose your path:'
      - "Trong thi\u1EC1n \u0111\u1ECBnh, ba b\u1ED9 *c\xF4ng ph\xE1p* hi\u1EC7n
        l\xEAn t\xE2m tr\xED. Ch\u1ECDn h\u01B0\u1EDBng \u0111\u1ED9t ph\xE1:"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Choice/3
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - A mysterious elder lays out three secret manuals. *Pick one:*
      - "M\u1ED9t l\xE3o nh\xE2n b\xED \u1EA9n b\xE0y ra ba cu\u1ED1n b\xED t\u1ECBch.
        *Ch\u1ECDn m\u1ED9t:*"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Spring/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You find a *spirit spring* and soak in it, circulating your qi. <b>+{heal}
        HP</b>.
      - "B\u1EA1n t\xECm th\u1EA5y m\u1ED9t *linh tuy\u1EC1n*, ng\xE2m m\xECnh v\u1EADn
        c\xF4ng \u0111i\u1EC1u t\u1EE9c. <b>+{heal} HP</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Spring/2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Dense spirit qi knits your wounds closed. <b>+{heal} HP</b>.
      - "Linh kh\xED \u0111\u1EADm \u0111\u1EB7c v\xE1 l\xE0nh th\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EBF
        c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n. <b>+{heal} HP</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Sidekick/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - A glowing *{s}* drifts out of the thicket and takes you as its master!
      - "M\u1ED9t *{s}* ph\xE1t s\xE1ng bay ra t\u1EEB l\xF9m c\xE2y, nh\u1EADn b\u1EA1n
        l\xE0m ch\u1EE7 nh\xE2n!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Sidekick/2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '*{s}*, a spirit artifact, joins your journey!'
      - "*{s}*, ph\xE1p b\u1EA3o h\u1EEFu linh, gia nh\u1EADp h\xE0nh tr\xECnh c\u1EE7a
        b\u1EA1n!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/SidekickFull/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - It chimes softly and leaves you a *healing pill* instead. <b>+{heal} HP</b>.
      - "N\xF3 kh\u1EBD ng\xE2n m\u1ED9t ti\u1EBFng r\u1ED3i \u0111\u1EC3 l\u1EA1i
        m\u1ED9t *vi\xEAn \u0111an* thay l\u1EDDi ch\xE0o. <b>+{heal} HP</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/SidekickJoin
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - ' <b>{s}</b> {d}.'
      - ' <b>{s}</b> {d}.'
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/SidekickPodFull
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - ' But you can attune to only three artifacts - make room, or send it off
        with a pill?'
      - " Nh\u01B0ng b\u1EA1n ch\u1EC9 luy\u1EC7n h\xF3a \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ba ph\xE1p
        b\u1EA3o - nh\u01B0\u1EDDng ch\u1ED7, hay ti\u1EC5n n\xF3 \u0111i k\xE8m
        m\u1ED9t vi\xEAn \u0111an?"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/SidekickSwap
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '*{r}* rings once more and fades into the qi. <b>{s}</b> {d}.'
      - "*{r}* ng\xE2n l\xEAn l\u1EA7n cu\u1ED1i r\u1ED3i tan v\xE0o linh kh\xED.
        <b>{s}</b> {d}."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Trap/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You step into an *ancient formation*! Sword qi lashes out before you break
        free. <b>-{dmg} HP</b>.
      - "B\u1EA1n gi\u1EABm ph\u1EA3i *tr\u1EADn ph\xE1p c\u1ED5*! Ki\u1EBFm kh\xED
        qu\u1EADt t\u1EDBi tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi b\u1EA1n k\u1ECBp tho\xE1t ra. <b>-{dmg}
        HP</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Trap/2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - A pocket of *miasma* bursts underfoot! <b>-{dmg} HP</b>.
      - "M\u1ED9t t\xFAi *ch\u01B0\u1EDBng kh\xED* bung ra d\u01B0\u1EDBi ch\xE2n!
        <b>-{dmg} HP</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Treasure/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Half-buried in moss: a predecessor''s *jade slip*! Studying it grants <b>+{xp}
        qi</b>.'
      - "V\xF9i n\u1EEDa trong r\xEAu: m\u1ED9t t\u1EA5m *ng\u1ECDc gi\u1EA3n* ti\u1EC1n
        nh\xE2n! Tham ng\u1ED9 n\xF3 cho <b>+{xp} tu vi</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Treasure/2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You pry open a *cave-abode chest* of faded elixirs. <b>+{xp} qi</b>.
      - "B\u1EA1n c\u1EA1y m\u1EDF m\u1ED9t *r\u01B0\u01A1ng \u0111\u1ED9ng ph\u1EE7*
        \u0111\u1EA7y \u0111an d\u01B0\u1EE3c t\xE0n h\u01B0\u01A1ng. <b>+{xp} tu
        vi</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/WorldClear/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The demonic qi settles. *{p}* is pacified - you ride your sword to the next
        realm. <b>+{n} spirit stones</b>.
      - "Y\xEAu kh\xED l\u1EAFng xu\u1ED1ng. *{p}* \u0111\xE3 b\xECnh \u0111\u1ECBnh
        - b\u1EA1n ng\u1EF1 ki\u1EBFm phi th\u0103ng t\u1EDBi c\xF5i k\u1EBF ti\u1EBFp.
        <b>+{n} linh th\u1EA1ch</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/LevelUpSuffix
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - ' <b>Breakthrough! {realm} Stage {lv}</b>'
      - " <b>\u0110\u1ED9t ph\xE1 {realm} t\u1EA7ng {lv}!</b>"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/IntroNewRun
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You set foot in *{p}* - spirit mist curls along the ridges. Tap <b>CULTIVATE</b>
        to set out.
      - "B\u1EA1n \u0111\u1EB7t ch\xE2n t\u1EDBi *{p}* - m\xE2y linh kh\xED v\u1EDDn
        quanh s\u01B0\u1EDDn n\xFAi. Ch\u1EA1m <b>TU LUY\u1EC6N</b> \u0111\u1EC3
        l\xEAn \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/IntroResume
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You emerge from seclusion - your journey through *{p}* continues. Tap <b>CULTIVATE</b>.
      - "Xu\u1EA5t quan - h\xE0nh tr\xECnh t\u1EA1i *{p}* v\u1EABn ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c.
        Ch\u1EA1m <b>TU LUY\u1EC6N</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Death
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Your meridians shatter... the *{e}* was too strong. Your soul drifts into
        the wheel of reincarnation.
      - "Kinh m\u1EA1ch \u0111\u1EE9t \u0111o\u1EA1n... *{e}* qu\xE1 m\u1EA1nh. Linh
        h\u1ED3n b\u1EA1n tr\xF4i v\xE0o v\xF2ng lu\xE2n h\u1ED3i."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/ElitePrefix
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Awakened {e}
      - "{e} Th\xE0nh Tinh"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/BeastName/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Stonefiend
      - "Th\u1EA1ch Qu\xE1i"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
